; An unbalanced transaction is reported and still applied, like beancount
; books it before checking balances: the sale finds the lot the mistyped buy
; added, so the balance assertion holds and the only error is the imbalance.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock "FIFO"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "Buy, mistyped cash"
  Assets:Stock   1 HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Cash   -9 USD

2020-01-03 * "Sell the lot"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   10 USD

2020-01-04 balance Assets:Stock 0 HOOL
